meta {
  name: 17. Admin List Cards
  type: http
  seq: 17
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/cards?page=1&limit=20
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{authToken}}
}

docs {
  # Admin List Virtual Dollar Cards

  Returns all BillXpress virtual dollar cards with their owners, statuses and
  maintenance state.

  ## Optional Filters

  - `page`
  - `limit` (maximum 100)
  - `status`: `PENDING`, `ACTIVE`, `FROZEN`, `FAILED`, or `TERMINATED`
  - `userId`
  - `maintenancePastDue`: `true` or `false`

  ## Admin Table Fields

  Show:

  - owner name, email and phone
  - card brand and masked PAN
  - BillXpress and provider card IDs
  - card status
  - current card balance
  - next and last maintenance dates
  - grace-period deadline
  - maintenance status
  - whether the card was frozen for maintenance
  - latest maintenance failure

  Full PAN, CVV and other card credentials are intentionally not returned.
  Admins should never have access to users' complete card credentials.
}
